hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1537.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid informed him that Umar ibn al-Khattab came out to them. He said"
"1537.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid informed him that Umar ibn al-Khattab came out to them. He said"
"1538.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Umar ibn al-Khattab asked advice about a man drinking wine. Ali ibn Abi Talib said to him"
"1538.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Umar ibn al-Khattab asked advice about a man drinking wine. Ali ibn Abi Talib said to him"
"1539.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he was asked about the hadd of the slave for wine. He said"
"1539.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he was asked about the hadd of the slave for wine. He said"
"1540.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1540.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1541.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1541.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1542.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Yaqub from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1542.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Yaqub from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1543.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1543.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1544.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Hubab al-Ansari from Abu Qatada al-Ansari that the Messenger of Allah"
"1544.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Hubab al-Ansari from Abu Qatada al-Ansari that the Messenger of Allah"
"1545.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha"
"1545.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha"
"1546.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1546.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1547.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1547.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1548.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ibn Wala al-Misri asked Abdullah ibn Abbas about what is squeezed from the grapes. Ibn Abbas replied"
"1548.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ibn Wala al-Misri asked Abdullah ibn Abbas about what is squeezed from the grapes. Ibn Abbas replied"
"1549.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik said"
"1549.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik said"
"1550.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that Waqid ibn Amr ibn Sad ibn Muadh informed him from Mahmud ibn Labid al- Ansari that when Umar ibn al-Khattab went to ash-Sham"
"1550.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that Waqid ibn Amr ibn Sad ibn Muadh informed him from Mahmud ibn Labid al- Ansari that when Umar ibn al-Khattab went to ash-Sham"
"1551.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that some men from Iraq said to him"
"1551.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that some men from Iraq said to him"
